      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KINGSBRAE TED (8) charged out of the boxes with a slick early split and went straight to the front, scoring an all the way win (17.06) over 300m at this track. Has won two of four starts from this draw. Expected to go well again. CALLA NAUGHTY (4) has been out of the placings last two but shapes well for this if she can recapture her dazzling win a few runs back, getting around this track over 300m in 17.01. Must include on winning run three back. ICE ON FIRE (3) tends to take a while to wind up and has hit the frame three on end now, running on to place (17.41) in a NG at this track last time. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Likely to be in the finish again. CYCLONE SEBAS (6) has a solid strike rate at this track and distance.",
